			"updated": 1783629805698,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "A graph is a non-linear data structure made up of vertices (nodes) and edges (connections) that\nrepresent relationships between objects. Unlike arrays or linked lists, graphs do not follow a\nsequential order.",
