			"seed": 1698937122,
			"version": 76,
			"versionNonce": 1614654462,
			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1783639922556,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "- Implementation: The element A[i][j] is set to 1 (or the edge weight) if an edge exists from vertex\n  i to vertex j. If no edge exists, the value is set to 0.\n- Advantages: Constant-Time Lookups: Querying whether a specific edge exists between two vertices \n  takes O(1) time complexity.\n    * Mathematical Operations: Graph properties can be computed using matrix multiplication.\n- Disadvantages: Memory Inefficiency: The space complexity is strictly O(V^2), regardless of how \n  many edges actually exist.",
			"rawText": "- Implementation: The element A[i][j] is set to 1 (or the edge weight) if an edge exists from vertex \n  i to vertex j. If no edge exists, the value is set to 0.\n- Advantages: Constant-Time Lookups: Querying whether a specific edge exists between two vertices \n  takes O(1) time complexity.\n    * Mathematical Operations: Graph properties can be computed using matrix multiplication.\n- Disadvantages: Memory Inefficiency: The space complexity is strictly O(V^2), regardless of how \n  many edges actually exist.",
			"fontSize": 20,
			"fontFamily": 8,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": "sLNpu0lU",
			"originalText": "- Implementation: The element A[i][j] is set to 1 (or the edge weight) if an edge exists from vertex \n  i to vertex j. If no edge exists, the value is set to 0.\n- Advantages: Constant-Time Lookups: Querying whether a specific edge exists between two vertices \n  takes O(1) time complexity.\n    * Mathematical Operations: Graph properties can be computed using matrix multiplication.\n- Disadvantages: Memory Inefficiency: The space complexity is strictly O(V^2), regardless of how \n  many edges actually exist.",
			"autoResize": true,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"hasTextLink": false,
			"link": null
		},
		{
			"id": "FSkmf6uc",
			"type": "rectangle",
			"x": -407.93493603344444,
			"y": 4465.231498246563,
			"width": 1098.490151811254,
			"height": 385,
			"angle": 0,
			"strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
