			"updated": 1783683766362,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "From this point forward, the computer doesn't care about \"Gaborone\" or \"Maun\".\nIt only cares about linking Node 0, Node 1, and Node 2.",
			"rawText": "From this point forward, the computer doesn't care about \"Gaborone\" or \"Maun\". It only cares about linking Node 0, Node 1, and Node 2.",
